# Accidental raw secret files.
# The committed chezmoi file should be:
#
#   create_private_github_pat.env.tmpl
#
# Never commit a real token file.

github_pat.env
private_github_pat.env
encrypted_github_pat.env
*.env

# Examples are safe if you add one later.
!*.env.example

# The chezmoi create-template stub is safe to commit.
!create_private_github_pat.env.tmpl